{"id":"d7ed38c661c35e87","group":"29","path":"29/29-lem-hastad-switching.md","title":"固定自由变量数的 Håstad 切换引理","display":"lem-hastad-switching — 固定自由变量数的 Håstad 切换引理","type":"lemma","metadata":{"type":"lemma","book":"Descriptive Complexity (Neil Immerman)","book_abbrev":"29","label":"29-lem-hastad-switching","aliases":["29-lem-hastad-switching"],"display":"lem-hastad-switching — 固定自由变量数的 Håstad 切换引理","depends_on":["[[29-df-boolean-restriction]]","[[29-df-ordered-dnf]]","[[29-df-canonical-decision-tree]]"],"source_locator":"Lemma13.2 and proof using Lemma13.3, pp.204–206, DjVu scans219–221","source_basis":"扫描219–221原图核对；保留正整数有效范围，修正原书零边界及解码措辞，见Remark。"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"lemma"},{"key":"book","html":"Descriptive Complexity (Neil Immerman)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"29"},{"key":"label","html":"29-lem-hastad-switching"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>29-lem-hastad-switching</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"lem-hastad-switching — 固定自由变量数的 Håstad 切换引理"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"e25523dc1eeba65a\" href=\"?note=e25523dc1eeba65a\" title=\"29-df-boolean-restriction\">29-df-boolean-restriction</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"e376b5c876ef4c86\" href=\"?note=e376b5c876ef4c86\" title=\"29-df-ordered-dnf\">29-df-ordered-dnf</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"d96a123476b0bcd3\" href=\"?note=d96a123476b0bcd3\" title=\"29-df-canonical-decision-tree\">29-df-canonical-decision-tree</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_locator","html":"Lemma13.2 and proof using Lemma13.3, pp.204–206, DjVu scans219–221"},{"key":"source_basis","html":"扫描219–221原图核对；保留正整数有效范围，修正原书零边界及解码措辞，见Remark。"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n,k,s,r\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n,k,s,r\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k,s\\geq1\">\\(k,s\\geq1\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"1\\leq r\">\\(1\\leq r\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"7r\\leq n\">\\(7r\\leq n\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p=r/n\\in(0,1/7]\">\\(p=r/n\\in(0,1/7]\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F\\in\\mathsf{DNF}_n\">\\(F\\in\\mathsf{DNF}_n\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"w_n(F)\\leq k\">\\(w_n(F)\\leq k\\)</span>，其语法、项序和限制 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R_n(F,\\rho)\">\\(R_n(F,\\rho)\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"e376b5c876ef4c86\" href=\"?note=e376b5c876ef4c86\" title=\"29-df-ordered-dnf\">29-df-ordered-dnf</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal R_n^r\">\\(\\mathcal R_n^r\\)</span> 是恰有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r\">\\(r\\)</span> 个自由变量的全部限制，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"e25523dc1eeba65a\" href=\"?note=e25523dc1eeba65a\" title=\"29-df-boolean-restriction\">29-df-boolean-restriction</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T_n\">\\(T_n\\)</span> 和 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"h_n\">\\(h_n\\)</span> 是 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"d96a123476b0bcd3\" href=\"?note=d96a123476b0bcd3\" title=\"29-df-canonical-decision-tree\">29-df-canonical-decision-tree</a> 的完整块查询树与边数高度。概率取有限集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal R_n^r\">\\(\\mathcal R_n^r\\)</span> 上的均匀分布，不采用各坐标独立留空的另一分布。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\frac{\\bigl|\\{\\rho\\in\\mathcal R_n^r\\mid h_n(T_n(R_n(F,\\rho)))\\geq s\\}\\bigr|}{|\\mathcal R_n^r|}&lt;(7pk)^s.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\frac{\\bigl|\\{\\rho\\in\\mathcal R_n^r\\mid h_n(T_n(R_n(F,\\rho)))\\geq s\\}\\bigr|}{|\\mathcal R_n^r|}&lt;(7pk)^s.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原图的尾事件是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"h\\geq s\">\\(h\\geq s\\)</span>，不是 OCR 文本层的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"h&gt;s\">\\(h&gt;s\\)</span>；参数行是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\\leq1/7\">\\(p\\leq1/7\\)</span>。原书还印为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s\\geq0\">\\(s\\geq0\\)</span>，但 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s=0\">\\(s=0\\)</span> 时左边为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"1\">\\(1\\)</span>，右边也为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"1\">\\(1\\)</span>，严格不等式不成立。若允许 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r=0\">\\(r=0\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s\\geq1\">\\(s\\geq1\\)</span>，两边同为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0\">\\(0\\)</span>，仍不成立。本条明确采用 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r,s\\geq1\">\\(r,s\\geq1\\)</span> 的有效版本；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r=0\">\\(r=0\\)</span> 的树高恒为零可由定义单独处理。</p>\n<p>计数论证如下。若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s&gt;r\">\\(s&gt;r\\)</span>，树沿分支不重复查询，尾事件为空，而右边严格为正。设 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"1\\leq s\\leq r\">\\(1\\leq s\\leq r\\)</span>，对坏限制选树中按分支位串字典序第一条长度至少 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s\">\\(s\\)</span> 的分支，并只取其前 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s\">\\(s\\)</span> 次查询。按首个未被否定的项划分查询块；各块查询变量组成非空位置子集 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S_j\\subseteq\\{1,\\ldots,k\\}\">\\(S_j\\subseteq\\{1,\\ldots,k\\}\\)</span>，总大小为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s\">\\(s\\)</span>。位置按原始序列 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F\">\\(F\\)</span> 中相应项的递增变量编号记录；不能把编码限制下已经化简的项重新编号。把这些自由变量改为满足相应文字的值，得到含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r-s\">\\(r-s\\)</span> 个自由变量的新限制；再记录每个查询位是否与原分支位相同的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s\">\\(s\\)</span> 位串。</p>\n<p>给定新限制、位置子集序列和位串，可以逐块解码：首个未被否定的项就是当前块的项；由位置子集恢复满足赋值，由位串恢复原分支赋值，然后继续下一块。较早的项原已被某个固定值否定，后续扩张不能使它恢复。因此此编码单射。原书解码段写“首个取值为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"1\">\\(1\\)</span> 的项”，但最后一块可能在项的变量尚未全部查询时截断，不能要求这个项已全真；使用“首个未被否定的项”处理完整块和截断末块，保留同一个编码与计数。</p>\n<p>令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Stars}(k,s)\">\\(\\mathrm{Stars}(k,s)\\)</span> 为这些位置子集序列。Lemma13.3 的生成式估计给出 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"|\\mathrm{Stars}(k,s)|\\leq\\gamma^s&lt;(k/\\ln2)^s\">\\(|\\mathrm{Stars}(k,s)|\\leq\\gamma^s&lt;(k/\\ln2)^s\\)</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(1+1/\\gamma)^k=2\">\\((1+1/\\gamma)^k=2\\)</span>。结合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"|\\mathcal R_n^r|=\\binom nr2^{n-r}\">\\(|\\mathcal R_n^r|=\\binom nr2^{n-r}\\)</span>，坏限制比例至多为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"|\\mathcal R_n^{r-s}|\\,|\\mathrm{Stars}(k,s)|\\,2^s/|\\mathcal R_n^r|\">\\(|\\mathcal R_n^{r-s}|\\,|\\mathrm{Stars}(k,s)|\\,2^s/|\\mathcal R_n^r|\\)</span>，严格小于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(4pk/((1-p)\\ln2))^s\">\\((4pk/((1-p)\\ln2))^s\\)</span>。当 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\\leq1/7\">\\(p\\leq1/7\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"4/((1-p)\\ln2)\\leq14/(3\\ln2)&lt;7\">\\(4/((1-p)\\ln2)\\leq14/(3\\ln2)&lt;7\\)</span>，得到断言。这里记录原图陈述、已读计数证明与上述局部修正；不把 OCR 或有限测试单独当作一般证明。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"29-df-boolean-restriction","status":"resolved","id":"e25523dc1eeba65a","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-boolean-restriction]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-ordered-dnf","status":"resolved","id":"e376b5c876ef4c86","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-ordered-dnf]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-canonical-decision-tree","status":"resolved","id":"d96a123476b0bcd3","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-canonical-decision-tree]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-ordered-dnf","status":"resolved","id":"e376b5c876ef4c86","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$F\\in\\mathsf{DNF}_n$ 且 $w_n(F)\\leq k$，其语法、项序和限制 $R_n(F,\\rho)$ 见 [[29-df-ordered-dnf]]。","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-boolean-restriction","status":"resolved","id":"e25523dc1eeba65a","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathcal R_n^r$ 是恰有 $r$ 个自由变量的全部限制，见 [[29-df-boolean-restriction]]；$T_n$ 和 $h_n$ 是 [[29-df-canonical-decision-tree]] 的完整块查询树与边数高度。概率取有限集合 $\\mathcal R_n^r$ 上的均匀分布，不采用各坐标独立留空的另一分布。","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-canonical-decision-tree","status":"resolved","id":"d96a123476b0bcd3","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathcal R_n^r$ 是恰有 $r$ 个自由变量的全部限制，见 [[29-df-boolean-restriction]]；$T_n$ 和 $h_n$ 是 [[29-df-canonical-decision-tree]] 的完整块查询树与边数高度。概率取有限集合 $\\mathcal R_n^r$ 上的均匀分布，不采用各坐标独立留空的另一分布。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"n,k,s,r\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"k,s\\geq1","display":false},{"tex":"1\\leq r","display":false},{"tex":"7r\\leq n","display":false},{"tex":"p=r/n\\in(0,1/7]","display":false},{"tex":"F\\in\\mathsf{DNF}_n","display":false},{"tex":"w_n(F)\\leq k","display":false},{"tex":"R_n(F,\\rho)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal R_n^r","display":false},{"tex":"r","display":false},{"tex":"T_n","display":false},{"tex":"h_n","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal R_n^r","display":false},{"tex":"\\frac{\\bigl|\\{\\rho\\in\\mathcal R_n^r\\mid h_n(T_n(R_n(F,\\rho)))\\geq s\\}\\bigr|}{|\\mathcal R_n^r|}<(7pk)^s.","display":true},{"tex":"h\\geq s","display":false},{"tex":"h>s","display":false},{"tex":"p\\leq1/7","display":false},{"tex":"s\\geq0","display":false},{"tex":"s=0","display":false},{"tex":"1","display":false},{"tex":"1","display":false},{"tex":"r=0","display":false},{"tex":"s\\geq1","display":false},{"tex":"0","display":false},{"tex":"r,s\\geq1","display":false},{"tex":"r=0","display":false},{"tex":"s>r","display":false},{"tex":"1\\leq s\\leq r","display":false},{"tex":"s","display":false},{"tex":"s","display":false},{"tex":"S_j\\subseteq\\{1,\\ldots,k\\}","display":false},{"tex":"s","display":false},{"tex":"F","display":false},{"tex":"r-s","display":false},{"tex":"s","display":false},{"tex":"1","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Stars}(k,s)","display":false},{"tex":"|\\mathrm{Stars}(k,s)|\\leq\\gamma^s<(k/\\ln2)^s","display":false},{"tex":"(1+1/\\gamma)^k=2","display":false},{"tex":"|\\mathcal R_n^r|=\\binom nr2^{n-r}","display":false},{"tex":"|\\mathcal R_n^{r-s}|\\,|\\mathrm{Stars}(k,s)|\\,2^s/|\\mathcal R_n^r|","display":false},{"tex":"(4pk/((1-p)\\ln2))^s","display":false},{"tex":"p\\leq1/7","display":false},{"tex":"4/((1-p)\\ln2)\\leq14/(3\\ln2)<7","display":false}],"bytes":3439,"backlinks":[{"id":"38909ffa6d1e85ce","anchor":"ref-170","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[29-df-boolean-restriction]]、[[29-df-canonical-decision-tree]]、[[29-df-ordered-dnf]]、[[29-lem-hastad-switching]]、[[29-thm-parity-ac0]] — 随机限制、DNF 规范树、切换引理及非一致 AC⁰ 奇偶性下界"},{"id":"0e17b36c42abaf3a","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"下式的 $c,k,d$ 是任意正整数资源参数，各输入长度的电路可以分别选择，不要求一阶一致性。切换引理的固定自由变量数版本见 [[29-lem-hastad-switching]]。"},{"id":"ecc0dd131d213345","anchor":"ref-159","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../29-lem-hastad-switching]]"},{"id":"08f453008a616925","anchor":"ref-17","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../29-lem-hastad-switching|29-lem-hastad-switching]]"}],"outgoing":["e25523dc1eeba65a","e376b5c876ef4c86","d96a123476b0bcd3"]}